WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.990
1873.

2
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.810
A traveller sits above a mountain
lake and writes a letter.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:10.910
Her first sentence: "I have found a dream
of beauty at which one might look all

4
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.290
one's life and sigh."

5
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.930
Now, today.

6
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.130
A vlogger at the same
lake grins into a phone:

7
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.210
"hi guys, welcome back".

8
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:24.410
Same water, same mountains,
more than a century apart.

9
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.900
So what changed, and why?

10
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.120
In this mission, you'll fill
in a frame for each text,

11
00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.280
one empty box at a time.

12
00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:37.850
You'll ask where each text sits, between
spontaneous speech and crafted writing.

13
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:41.040
And you'll compare them
closely: what stayed,

14
00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.850
as well as what moved.

15
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:47.160
Your mission: work out what changed
between the letter and the vlog.
